Stardew Valley game art
-----------------------
Stardew Valley, its name, and all of its art (including the sprites and farm
map images in public/assets/sprites, public/assets/layouts and
public/assets/game) are © ConcernedApe LLC. They are used here, unmodified
apart from cropping, for non-commercial fan purposes only, and are not covered
by this project's code license. If ConcernedApe asks, they will be removed.

- public/assets/sprites and public/assets/layouts: copied from the v2
  Stardew Valley planner repository (see below), whose author extracted them
  from the game.
- public/assets/game: cropped from the game's own content files by
  scripts/import-game.mts.

